Agent Reliability Lab ("Lab of Night and Flame")
Copyright 2026 Vico Winner Sebastian Aritonang

This product includes software developed by Vico Winner Sebastian Aritonang
as an open-source laboratory for experimenting with, measuring and improving
AI agents: arl/1 trace capture, OpenTelemetry ingest, Workbench replay of
saved agent state, evaluation campaigns, human feedback and judge calibration.

The public contracts of the lab (api/openapi.yaml, api/proto/arl/v1 and
api/schemas) are part of this product and are distributed under the same
Apache License, Version 2.0, so that clients and agents in any programming
language can be generated from them.

